{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:33:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_bdfe7ea9569c487f9a6531d7dc48b162","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_09ab4cfcdae81b1ed767c2a3e3c2cc7d3a879a94748cda7c9e45ce9f299020f5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"andrefetch/postal@240622b0c2dc snapshot d2cc8dfe1c666ebc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5e921f724ace56022ec9a239486253e4f6441b251d48b1a4c2e08c3e88871c75","slc_d12fda75bd7b321526f198e904e4b0656fa6bdf20d64b4a1cae4a93ebce9116a","slc_e3d1a5e018ee964552c2d7c87badf9c6e835ff8de44067ffc30d7b4bc463fd74"],"source_ids":["src_22f56ca5b9c9557a873e173ad92b5905","src_e013041a81735954904485f869b363ff"],"text":"The main agent can delegate to five specialized sub-agents (codebase_investigator, code_reviewer, software_architect, test_writer, debugger), each running its own loop with a narrowed tool set and turn cap; sub-agent runs are never checkpointed.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:33:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bdfe7ea9569c487f9a6531d7dc48b162"}
