{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:33:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_bdfe7ea9569c487f9a6531d7dc48b162","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_86b78ec86694be8834b2cfd7acd0c43942a0004ebda5145cc6a4ad1a3cca5e0f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"andrefetch/postal@240622b0c2dc snapshot d2cc8dfe1c666ebc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9c6213863a2bf2bfaa2d0eaeee76cc83eccb27a8edb3964ff335af9cea826125","slc_fced553ee19e49b0cd3bac5009027c303a546bde96ccd2bf2bfd722c1ed527c7"],"source_ids":["src_22f56ca5b9c9557a873e173ad92b5905"],"text":"The TUI supports slash commands including /model, /approval, /thinking, /clear, /stats, /tools, /mcp, /sessions, /resume, /checkpoint, /rewind and /exit, with autocomplete as the user types.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:33:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bdfe7ea9569c487f9a6531d7dc48b162"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:33:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_bdfe7ea9569c487f9a6531d7dc48b162","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_86e8f2900261b629e153cd1dde98953fa87e3276d94a1f53b2e2d80915c0a5ee","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"andrefetch/postal@240622b0c2dc snapshot d2cc8dfe1c666ebc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_11dc6960e81a079132ba4c2e31a6ff3ca0df5de55ef4190155ab18dd611b1678","slc_132d1343be627ccbc35ea276cf69804a4f92bace3df6658260db763b0d99cb68","slc_91cfba7eee8f0dc8983d9aca3e286b9e4bb2a715a562fed20f90cb132b4299cf"],"source_ids":["src_17a4b3dc3e095a57be519fce98198a62","src_22f56ca5b9c9557a873e173ad92b5905"],"text":"Six approval policies govern mutating actions: on_request (default), auto_edit, auto, on_fail (currently identical to auto), never (read-only), and yolo; read-only tools never prompt.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:33:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bdfe7ea9569c487f9a6531d7dc48b162"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:33:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_bdfe7ea9569c487f9a6531d7dc48b162","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8796e11e418c56d54480904700c96f54ff83e4ae1f8771d328fe3dccfdd2f116","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"andrefetch/postal@240622b0c2dc snapshot d2cc8dfe1c666ebc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ea2efa80ab126f025bafff0d4c41eb43739734b6ac3f84691e0307ba96686f37","slc_edad0b2b0886712e4a547907426406239d53b6e2f4b1e5c050f79494724a7c49","slc_fcbc509a201de924cbd42e8a5dc6facd44d82b4031532f004fa700a472135ed6"],"source_ids":["src_17a4b3dc3e095a57be519fce98198a62","src_22f56ca5b9c9557a873e173ad92b5905"],"text":"Two rules override any policy except yolo: dangerous commands (e.g. rm -rf /, mkfs, curl piped to bash) are rejected, and anything touching paths outside the working directory requires confirmation (or is rejected under never).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:33:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bdfe7ea9569c487f9a6531d7dc48b162"}
